--- !u!114 &1954796540
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1954796539}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2c7a3609eca5b5e4587d52ee66c779dd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueIntro
  caronteBoxRoot: {fileID: 1711743492}
  caronteDialogueText: {fileID: 1980540221}
  protaBoxRoot: {fileID: 498001951}
  protaDialogueText: {fileID: 621183308}
  caronteSprite: {fileID: 518922339}
  protaSprite: {fileID: 1517976384}
  caronteUIImage: {fileID: 0}
  protaUIImage: {fileID: 0}
  dimMultiplier: 0.45
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: "So\u2026 you are the one who wishes to take my place one day."
  - speaker: 0
    text: Do you understand what that truly means?
  - speaker: 1
    text: I thought it meant guiding souls across the river.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Helping the dead find their final path.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Guiding them? Helping them? How cute.\nThis is not mercy\u2026 this is
      duty."
  - speaker: 0
    text: For centuries I have ferried the lost, the damned, the forgotten.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Not one of them crossed without paying the price.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "The price\u2026 you mean the obols, right?\n"
  - speaker: 1
    text: The coins the dead carry for the passage?
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'Exactly. Nothing moves in the underworld without balance.

      No coin,
      no crossing.'
  - speaker: 0
    text: And today, your training begins with a simple task.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Bring me fifteen obols from wandering souls.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Fifteen? That sounds\u2026 like a lot. What do you need so many for?"
  - speaker: 0
    text: That is not for you to question yet.
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'The obols are more than payment. '
  - speaker: 0
    text: "They are memory, regret\u2026 unfinished business made metal."
  - speaker: 1
    text: So every coin carries a story?
  - speaker: 0
    text: Now you begin to understand.
  - speaker: 0
    text: And understanding is heavier than any boat.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Collect the fifteen obols. Then return to me\u2026 and I will tell you
      why I truly need them."
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Alright\u2026 I\u2019ll do it. I won\u2019t fail you, master."
  - speaker: 0
    text: "We shall see, apprentice. The river is patient\u2026 but I am not."
  letterDelay: 0.03
  gameplaySceneName: CARONTE_Scene
  fadeCanvasGroup: {fileID: 2026988871}
  fadeOutTime: 2.5
